"clip":"We draw $R\\,b_0^2$ on a signed logarithmic scale, linear within $0.001$ of zero, from $-10$ to $0$, with every value inside the panel.","legend":[["line","R","$R$, the Ricci scalar"]]}},"settings":"$b_0 = 1$, the throat radius and unit of length, with $|l| \\le \\sqrt{24}\\,b_0$.","input":"$\\Phi = 0$ and $r(l) = \\sqrt{l^2 + b_0^2}$, equivalent to $b(r) = b_0^2/r$.","clip":"We draw $K\\,b_0^4$ on a logarithmic scale from $10^{-5}$ to $10^2$, with every value inside the panel. We draw $R\\,b_0^2$ on a signed logarithmic scale, linear within $0.001$ of zero, from $-10$ to $0$, with every value inside the panel."}]}
